#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:5
#: 0a4c29a045894b48976cd9cc7b305bab
msgid "KDE CAN ESCs"
msgstr "KDE CAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:9
#: bd568f3517494920ab956e7d4445aece
msgid ""
"KDECAN ESCs are high-end ESCs that allow control and feedback using a custom"
" CAN protocol"
msgstr "KDECAN ESC 是高端 ESC，可通过自定义 CAN 协议进行控制和反馈"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:11
#: f4e440a4325a4970b2e5b4845b04a5d3
msgid ""
"KDE has released new firmware that offers the option of using standard "
"DroneCAN protocol or their custom CAN protocol. The following page details "
"setup using older firmware or newer firmware when the custom CAN protocol is"
" selected. To setup for use as a standard DroneCAN ESC see the firmware "
"update and setup instructions `here "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0496/8205/files/DroneCAN_QuickStart_1.0.3.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"KDE 发布了新固件，提供使用标准 DroneCAN 协议或其自定义 CAN 协议的选项。以下页面详细介绍了使用旧固件或选择自定义 CAN "
"协议时的新固件设置。要作为标准 DroneCAN ESC 使用，请参阅 `此处 "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0496/8205/files/DroneCAN_QuickStart_1.0.3.pdf>`__"
" 的固件更新和设置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:14
#: 00c4b47b6d5d47848458981b06724cda
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:16
#: 7a8a169844764d8e8fdd16cd9ec1d67f
msgid ""
"`KDE-UAS125UVC-HE <https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-"
"electronics/products/kde-uas125uvc-he>`__ and `KDE-UAS85UVC "
"<https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-"
"electronics/products/kde-uas85uvc>`__ can be purchased from `KDEDirect.com "
"<https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-electronics>`__ "
"(other KDE ESCs may also support CAN, check the images of the ESC, those "
"with \"CAN\" written on the side should work)."
msgstr ""
"`KDE-UAS125UVC-HE <https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-"
"electronics/products/kde-uas125uvc-he>`__ 和 `KDE-UAS85UVC "
"<https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-"
"electronics/products/kde-uas85uvc>`__ 可从 `KDEDirect.com "
"<https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-electronics>`__ 购买（其他"
" KDE ESC 也可能支持 CAN，请查看 ESC 图片，侧面标有 「CAN」 字样的应该可以使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:17
#: a2dd233f8f4143659e017a6d055e9948
msgid ""
"`KDECAN Wire Kit <https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/kdecan-bus-"
"cables/products/kdecan-kit-jst-ghr-wire-kit>`__ is also required"
msgstr ""
"还需要 `KDECAN 连接线套件 <https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/kdecan-bus-"
"cables/products/kdecan-kit-jst-ghr-wire-kit>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:20
#: 32cf50b7d9aa4937b41c4cf93c3c20ee
msgid "Configuring the ESCs"
msgstr "配置 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:22
#: 0f6c08bf66c14728a8ca747bd49b4832
msgid ""
"`KDE's instructions for connecting and configuring with ArduPilot are here "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0496/8205/files/KDECAN_Pixhawk_QuickStart.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"`KDE 与 ArduPilot 连接和配置的说明在此 "
"<https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0496/8205/files/KDECAN_Pixhawk_QuickStart.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:24
#: c9e08e9c39c94befba23fc6234194d49
msgid ""
"Download, install and run the `KDE Direct Device Manager "
"<https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-rotor-"
"electronics/products/kde-dms?page=specs>`__"
msgstr ""
"下载、安装并运行 `KDE Direct 设备管理器 <https://www.kdedirect.com/collections/uas-multi-"
"rotor-electronics/products/kde-dms?page=specs>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:25
#: c769acbaee274c5eba6d3a12ca3c4040
msgid ""
"Connect the first ESC to your PC with a USB cable and configure the device "
"as shown below"
msgstr "通过 USB 线将第一个 ESC 连接到电脑，并按如下所示配置设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:31
#: 1b03bc14515d4bc99ad769c022326a24
msgid ""
"Repeat the configuration of all other ESCs increasing the \"KDECAN ESC ID\" "
"by one each time.  It is best to label the ESC with a number that is the ESC"
" ID - 1. Somewhat confusingly the lowest ESC IDs is 02 but this will mirror "
"the autopilot's SERVO1 output"
msgstr ""
"对所有其他 ESC 重复配置，每次将 「KDECAN ESC ID」 增加 1。最好在 ESC 上标注编号，编号为 ESC ID - "
"1。有些令人困惑的是，最低的 ESC ID 是 02，但这将对应飞控的 SERVO1 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:34
#: 94318a00de3d4b74b55f8329d5dce977
msgid "Connecting the ESCs"
msgstr "连接 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:36
#: b57c35316d6848b29c7989bc2c76ff7e
msgid ""
"The 4-pin cable connecting the first ESC to the autopilot's CAN1 port must "
"have all pins swapped on one end (ideally on the end connecting to the first"
" ESC).  Pin1 (red) should be swapped with Pin4.  Pin2 should be swapped with"
" Pin3.  This modified cable should be used to connect the autopilot's CAN1 "
"port to the first ESC"
msgstr ""
"将第一个 ESC 连接到飞控 CAN1 端口的 4 芯线缆，必须在一端（理想情况下是连接到第一个 ESC "
"的一端）将所有引脚对调。引脚1（红色）应与引脚4对调，引脚2应与引脚3对调。此改制线缆用于连接飞控的 CAN1 端口与第一个 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:37
#: 7a456b3292924768b61681d164aed63d
msgid ""
"The ESCs should be daisy chained together using the KDECAN Wire Kit.  The "
"CAN terminator (the 4-pin connector with a black loop) should be connected "
"to the last ESC in the chain"
msgstr "ESC 应使用 KDECAN 连接线套件进行菊链连接。CAN 终端（带黑色环路的 4 芯连接器）应连接到链路中最后一个 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:45
#: 8cd31b451f1645bdaffedd08d4e1be5c
msgid ""
"If using a CubeBlack autopilot, the CAN1 and CAN2 labels are reversed.  "
"These instructions assume the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port which is "
"labelled \"CAN2\" on CubeBlack autopilots"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 CubeBlack 飞控，CAN1 和 CAN2 标签是反的。这些说明假设 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口，而 CubeBlack "
"飞控上标记为 「CAN2」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:48
#: 241a84208d4e457f81a583f54410da13
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:50
#: c9d85dde2a544539bca9f70b43f59a40
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (KDECAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 8（KDECAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:51
#: 1b883a1422094d02a28c7c3b2eee131d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify that "
"the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:52
#: 38e45d0ce41842c786334e24a8e51b86
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 以及 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 使用与 ESC 输入范围匹配的输出范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:53
#: e1c737e17b924e8bb490b2ac85652301
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`KDE_NPOLE <KDE_NPOLE>` to the number of poles on the motor (Note "
"it may be necessary to reboot the autopilot to cause this parameter to "
"appear).  If you are not sure of the number, you can probably count them by "
"looking closely into the top of the motor.  Even if set incorrectly the "
"motors should spin normally because this number is only used to calculate "
"the RPM reported to the ground station and stored in the onboard logs"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`KDE_NPOLE <KDE_NPOLE>` "
"设置为电机的极数（注意可能需要重启飞控才能显示该参数）。如果不确定极数，可以通过仔细观察电机顶部来数。即使设置不正确，电机也应能正常旋转，因为该数值仅用于计算向地面站报告的转速和记录在机载日志中的转速"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:56
#: b76c22ffbd344884bcb10baa605b102a
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:58
#: a664c3f5e61a44849ecde1e3c9bf8e18
msgid ""
"KDECAN ESCs provide information back to the autopilot which is recorded in "
"the autopilot's onboard log's ESCn messages and can be viewed in any "
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This information "
"includes:"
msgstr ""
"KDECAN ESC 向飞控反馈信息，记录在飞控机载日志的 ESCn 消息中，可通过任何 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容的日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:60
#: aa5ecde913a84722b429c2b8749bdfdb
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "转速（RPM）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:61
#: 358cc6382ecb44bda8500cb2830e977b
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:62
#: f6f76627de4a4a3382008c55f7c82606
msgid "Current"
msgstr "电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:63
#: b8617e33e3564c9bb0fe13492e44953d
msgid "ESC Temperature"
msgstr "ESC 温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:64
#: c9ed1e76532049bd9c5daeaabb123161
msgid "Total Current"
msgstr "总电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:66
#: 79686e8b1feb473d901f5ff9ecf02a0c
msgid ""
"The RCOU messages are also written to the onboard logs which hold the "
"requested output level sent to the ESCs expressed as a number from 1000 "
"(meaning stopped) to 2000 (meaning full output)."
msgstr "RCOU 消息也会写入机载日志，记录发送给 ESC 的请求输出电平，以 1000（表示停止）到 2000（表示全速输出）的数值表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:68
#: 99405ff1e01944d1b9e5b5d2a7773a23
msgid ""
"This information can also be viewed in real-time using a ground station.  If"
" using the Mission Planner go to the Flight Data screen's status tab and "
"look for esc1_rpm."
msgstr "这些信息也可以使用地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，请进入飞行数据界面的状态标签页，查找 esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kde-can-escs.rst:76
#: 62283d46cb874f8ba90299279551be6b
msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial port "
"number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"将 ESC 数据发送到 GCS 需要使用 MAVLink2。请检查相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数是否为 2（其中 「x」 "
"是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"
